# The WeChat QR detector weights are third-party model inputs that get embedded in the exe verbatim.
# Without this, git would treat the .prototxt files as text and rewrite their line endings on checkout,
# so a fresh clone would embed different bytes from the ones this build was tested against — a failure
# that would appear only on the cloned machine, and only when Flash Sync's camera receiver starts.
AA/FlashSync/Models/* -text
